  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Make Polluters Pay core grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding to Stamp Out Poverty to support the development and running of the Make Polluters Pay Coalition. Stamp&apos;s staff member is acting as network coordinator and this money will contribute towards that capacity and any core costs of getting the coalition established. The aim of the coalition is to increase awareness of the need for funding for loss and damage and create the political pressure to force UK contributions to a fund.</narrative>
  </description>
